    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ina báy, «Heewí, aariím daanduú Goguwo, kubeeto, Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, ‹Aníng nee kuúng, ti araán, kuúng Gógu, waawutmoó úr oo xoordaá Mesheki nee Tubali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng kuúng u warqeés uri paslís bihhaá hatlá' i ale, nee uri gan'aás iimír amoodá' saaw ar bihhaá /iikú wa ale, as tlom'iidaá Israeli kiwa i haratleer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo ga/aleerók ar dákw doó basáy an geeqáw nee maheeriwók awa dákw doó /iyáy niri yaamií huuiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng a gwá' gawaá tlom'aá Israeli, kuúng dinkwa nee slaqwaruuseerók sleémeero nee xoordaá dinkwa nee kuúng. Aníng slaqooín in haniís as kiwa /ayi nee tsir/ór gawaá doori ar umuú kalaywo nee makaá xaraaslá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng a gwá' baraá sla/a. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng asla a huúw baraá yaamaá Magogu nee kudá' sleémeero hootá' ar wayda dír yaamaá afkú tlawto. Inooín ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuueé' kudá' hhoohhoó' muk'eé' oo Israeli guri tsaahh, slám a baloó ya/amaaká umuueé' kudá' hhoohhoó' kuwa male slasla/areesi. Nee xoordu sleémeero ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, kudá' hhoohhoó' oo Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Deeloorí ni daanda kah ar tsuwa ló' ni hardát. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe, mukdá' hoót baraá gixsadaá Israeli tindin ti'iit, xoosladár slaqwara taa geexáy kari burumbuur nee kari daa/ ar asla. Ga/aldu, nee maheeri, nee lawlu nee guhhli'i kiri baraá ásltí qaas adór migír ay kureeri faanqw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Migír ngu ay'aaká baraá slá/tí ale, laqaá xaai ngi tlaquú ay'aaká baraá darma, asma xooslaadár slaqwara ngin ásltár oohamisiyá'. Inooín daqaari'iimár mukdá' aáng daqaari'iimar'ín gaa hayoh ngin hayohír, nee muruú mukdá' muruuín gwa ar tlay ngun ar tlayá'. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Baalaadae aníng dír Gogu kway fooli an sláw baraá yaamaá Israeliwo, baraá Tlapár Aauuse, tidá' ta bay Abdarimu, bihhaá da/aáw awa Tlawtá Diwi. Gogu kun didií fool dinkwa nee slaqwaruuseerós sleémeero, nee múk aauuse kuri ilaa/ as miwa loohidár óh. Tlapár slaqwaruusér Gogu, tidá' ta bay, ‹Tlapár Hamoni-gogu.› ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu'uudá' kin folaalit ay slahheeri faanqw as yaamaá Israeli kiwa hhoohhoeesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu sleémeero baraá yaamuudae tu'uudá' gin foliit. Nee gaarí an gár xirfuú huwahuuw dir'ine, baldá' xirfuueé' bura geehhooatís. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alaá slahheeriiká' faanqwe muu kun tsawaar iwa waraahhi umuú diiro as tu'uudá' taa fooliiká kiwa leelehhiiti, kiri foól as yaamuuín kiwa hhoohhoeesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár barta waarahh baraá yaamuwo, barnaxes fartá hee kaa ár, slaqsaay kun didií qaas as múk fooliít bira hardáh nguwa ari, gway fool baraá Tlapár Hamoni-gogu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amoodaádae gixsár ta bay Hamona i deer sleeme. Adoorí an adoodá' yaamu kir hheehhe'eesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Hamí daxta, heewí, anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ a kah, Tsir/o sleémeero ateeteek, nee makaá sla/a sleémeerowo, burumbureek bihhe sleémeerowo as muruú /aymaadá' naa amohhe'eés ilahhooár muruú taa tsuú/ nguwa /aymár aya', muruú /aymadár deelór ló'wa ur gawaá tlom'aá Israeliro. Inooín fu'unaay ngay /ayiyá' nee tseere ngay wahaná'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fu'unaá múk pihh'uumár koóm ngin /ayá', nee tseerér geeraharuuseedá' uren ar baraá yaamu, tidá' ta tsu/i adór gwaandaawér wa ale, laqaá adór deeloó bee/aangw, nee laqaá adór aara, laqaá adór awér aa wahhdit ar Bashani ngiri wahiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá muruú /aymaarí ni inooín i tlehhiita, wahhna ngiri /ayiyá', nari aaxiyá'. Tseere ngin wahiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá meésar'eene, slaqwaruuseedá' farsuú i tsa/aa/am, nee pihhuuse, nee slaqwaruuse sleémeerowo kan aaxiis. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ina báy, «Aníng xoordu sleémeero i xirfuueé' i laqaám, nee adoodá' /uuruueé' ngur ar gadiyuús, as sakwasleemar'eé' tidár gan'amu ngiwa dir'ín i laqaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Israeli gari tsaahh adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín, iimír baldá' ay aluudae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xoordaá hatlá' ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór múk Israeli gár isa diya/aát tar tlakweemaín kudá' taa tleéhh dir'eene. Nina dee/aanutiyé' aníng ngiri alaá xu'ús as miwa ariyé', nee ngiri qaás gawaá dabaá wakuuser'ín as kiwa tsu/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana alií warqáw miwa ariyé', adoodá' inooín wa hariim ana dir'ínií tleéhh ar har qoomoó slasla/aruuín nee dakuúsar'ín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Gawaá adoorihe anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ ana oó', Hám daxta múk Israeli, xwaylár Yakobo in gurtláw ngiri dihhooar'ín i ki/ís. Aníng umuú daqisleeme gár ni slaa' a umuueé' kudá' hhoohhoó' kuwa ilaiwawa/i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár barta hoot ar wayda baraá yaamuuine, qoomár bar gár gi dae tlaaq i káhh, alsi'imuuín kudá' naa tleehhiyé' ngun gunqaresiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaarihe inooín iga qaroó ki/ís baraá xoorduú wa alé, nee ngaa qaroó burumbuúr baraá yaamaá wakuuser'ín wa ale, nee hhohhoaarir'eé' ngiri geehhooatís dír geeraá xoordaá hatlae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní ngiri tsaahhiyá' adór aníng tar AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, Munguúín, asma aníng ina tlatlahhaás baraá tla/ángw xoordaá hatlá', nee ngiri male ki/ís baraá yaamuuín. Tam heé wák u geexawaaká baraá tla/ángw xoordaá hatlá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng qoomár qeeruueé' bura ku'uús gawaá múk Israeli, gitsee/aeé' i malé lu/aaká dír múk Israeliwo. Anuú Aakoó MUNGÚ tí aga oó'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
